Copyright 2026 Mingshan He and FlapSim contributors

This product includes software developed as part of the FlapSim project
(https://github.com/MingshanHe/FlapSim).

The quasi-steady blade-element aerodynamic model, including the empirical
normal-force coefficient and centre-of-pressure fits, reproduces the model
used by the FlapX flapping-wing simulator (Purdue University). FlapSim is an
independent implementation; see docs/derivations for the derivation.
